// The engine runner's storeless smoke fixture: function tests that read from no store, so legend-engine compiles each
// plan to Java, with javac over the class path ClassGraph reads (perf.AbsoluteClassPath). One test passes, one fails,
// and one raises: substring past the end, whose text is the JDK's (the S383 probe, 2026-11-19).
function smoke::middle(): String[1]
{
  'abcdef'->substring(1, 3)
}
{
  right | middle() => 'bc';
  wrong | middle() => 'x';
}

function smoke::pastTheEnd(): String[1]
{
  'abcdef'->substring(7)
}
{
  raised | pastTheEnd() => 'x';
}
